    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR updates profile/spec definitions and generation so that profile-derived configuration artifacts are stricter and more internally consistent, and adds CI coverage to prevent drift.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add/propagate `requirements` conditions into profiles and generated profile configs; generate *strict* profile configs (transitively-expanded requirements).\n- Update profile/ext version constraints (notably several `~> 1.x` → `~> 1.0` and `~> 2.2` → `~> 2.2.0`) and normalize profile `mode` values (e.g. `Unpriv` → `U`).\n- Add CI/regression checks and unit tests to validate configs and ensure generated artifacts are up-to-date.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 47 out of 50 changed files in this pull request and generated 8 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tools/test/regress-tests.yaml | Adds a regression job intended to regenerate strict profile configs and fail on drift. |\r\n| .github/workflows/regress.yml | Generated workflow updated to include the new strict profile-config drift job. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/test/test_cfg.rb | Extends config-validation unit tests to include `cfgs/profile/*.yaml`. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/obj/portfolio.rb | Adds strict profile-config generation and propagates `requirements` into emitted configs. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/obj/parameter.rb | Adds `Parameter#to_condition` helper. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/cli.rb | Adds `--strict-partial` option and allows validating profile configs by name. |\r\n| Rakefile | Generates strict profile configs (`profile.to_strict_config`) and moves instruction-appendix golden location. |\r\n| backends/instructions_appendix/tasks.rake | Points instruction-appendix golden diff test at `tests/golden/all_instructions.golden.adoc`. |\r\n| tests/golden/REUSE.toml | Marks generated golden AsciiDoc files as CC0 via REUSE annotations. |\r\n| .pre-commit-config.yaml | Excludes generated profile config directory from trailing-whitespace fixer. |\r\n| tools/python/profile_extensions.golden | Updates expected profile extension/version listings. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVI20U32.yaml | Normalizes `mode` and adds `requirements`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVI20U64.yaml | Adds `requirements` for the 64-bit variant. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVA20U64.yaml | Normalizes `mode`, adds explicit versions, and updates `requirements`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVA20S64.yaml | Updates Sv* versions and expands `requirements`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVA22U64.yaml | Normalizes `mode` and adds `requirements`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVA22S64.yaml | Updates Sv* versions and adds `requirements`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVA23U64.yaml | Normalizes `mode`, adds missing version keys, and adds `requirements`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVA23S64.yaml | Adds missing version keys and adds `requirements`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVB23U64.yaml | Normalizes `mode` and adds `requirements`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/profile/RVB23S64.yaml | Updates Zifencei/Sv* versions, adds missing version keys, and adds `requirements`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/param/MTVEC_MODES.yaml | Replaces ad-hoc IDL requirements with structured `if/then` condition. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/ext/A.yaml | Moves A’s requirements to top-level and expresses them structurally. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/ext/S.yaml | Adds per-version dependency constraints on `Sm`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/ext/Sv32.yaml | Collapses versioning and encodes requirements as structured conditions. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/ext/Sv39.yaml | Collapses versioning and encodes requirements as structured conditions. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/ext/Sv48.yaml | Collapses versioning and encodes requirements as structured conditions. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/ext/Sv57.yaml | Updates version baseline. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/ext/Zawrs.yaml | Restores `1.0.0` and keeps `1.0.1` with ratification metadata. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/ext/Zihpm.yaml | Removes legacy IDL requirements stanza. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/csr/mcycleh.yaml | Changes `definedBy` to reference `Sm`. |\r\n| spec/custom/isa/csc_development/profile/RVB23M64.yaml | Introduces custom not-ratified M-mode profile with requirements. |\r\n| spec/custom/isa/csc_development/profile/RVA23M64.yaml | Introduces custom not-ratified M-mode profile inheriting from other profiles. |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVI20U32.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, version normalization). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVI20U64.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, version normalization). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVA20U64.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, transitive expansions). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVA20S64.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, transitive expansions). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVA22U64.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, transitive expansions). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVA22S64.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, transitive expansions). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVA23U64.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, additional mandatory transitive extensions). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVA23S64.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, additional mandatory transitive extensions). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVB23U64.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, transitive expansions). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVB23S64.yaml | Regenerated strict profile config output (+requirements, transitive expansions). |\r\n| cfgs/profile/README.adoc | Documents strictness and generation source for profile configs. |\r\n| cfgs/rv64-vector.yaml | Updates Sv39 version used by example config. |\r\n| cfgs/rv64-riscv-tests.yaml | Updates Sv39 version used by example config. |\r\n| cfgs/example_rv64_with_overlay.yaml | Updates Sv39/Sv48 versions used by example config. |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVB23M64.yaml | Removes previously checked-in generated M-mode profile config. |\r\n| cfgs/profile/RVA23M64.yaml | Removes previously checked-in generated M-mode profile config. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
